name: ['Avacyn, Angel of Hope', 'Capture of Jingzhou', 'Doran, the Siege Tower', 'Gaddock Teeg', 'Homeward Path', 'Pendelhaven', 'Prismatic Geoscope', 'Rules Lawyer', 'Spellskite']
